// The `actionEventCaps` catch-all hole, not inherited: Draw is a verb the
// Idris catch-all would silently swallow — the emitted table has no Draw row,
// so it is cost-INELIGIBLE, never silently capless-but-legal [CR#118.3].
Normal(
  name: "Reject Draw Cost",
  types: [Artifact],
  abilities: [
    Activated(cost: [Do(Draw(1))], effect: GainLife(1)),
  ],
)
